OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim's contact with
OL,4,Apolice to be examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Hassall said the Government
OL,7,Fneeded to "do more" to promote
OL,8,Funderstanding of risks generated by
OL,9,Fpeople's coercive control of partners.
OL,11,FWaddell was jailed for a minimum of 32
OL,12,Fyears in September 2023, after being
OL,13,Fconvicted of murdering Albone at her
OL,14,Fhome in Winston Crescent, Biggleswade.
